    "admission": "Choose exactly one QUESTION or TASK operation at declaration. Bind caster's actual selected faith/recipient relationship and the recipient's permission to answer/perform this operation; do not infer universal omniscience or a deity genealogy. Synthetic TEST-PATRON-DD11 is authorized only as a test recipient, not a new canonical god.",
